<body id="thebody" style="defaultCaption">
	<div xml:lang="en">
		<p begin="00:00:00.400" end="00:00:02.733">Here are some words<br />that begin with the letter &quot;k.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:02.733" end="00:00:03.933">(makes &quot;k&quot; sound)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:03.933" end="00:00:05.400">Kite.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:05.400" end="00:00:07.600">Kayak.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:07.600" end="00:00:09.333">Kilt.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:09.333" end="00:00:10.733">Kettle.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:10.733" end="00:00:12.033">Kitten.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:13.133" end="00:00:14.133">Ketchup.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:14.133" end="00:00:16.000">Kimono.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:16.000" end="00:00:17.000">(tooting)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:17.000" end="00:00:17.933">Kazoo.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:17.933" end="00:00:19.000">&quot;K.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:19.000" end="00:00:20.000">(makes &quot;k&quot; sound)</p>
</div>
